{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955ba38914710e96a95ebe07aaada016953a8d07f32089594358e1f7a0ff5b30",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了。\n展现出了超越练习水平的绝佳表演哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aefddba1b5685e5b7a19bd334883c9d64178d64d079453b942e51857fb5783a5",
      "text": "…刚才的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82ee4153abfa78d94b0957a04825a811a7bfb074ba26c86c4af21d4a13d7e174",
      "text": "……刚才的舞台，我们看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27743bec9e90aed4d946ccb2c96d1da8382f6621c88e685ab170fe12502d7986",
      "text": "F-LAGS和我们一样，\n是名副其实的正经偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb5faf93eb781d09a1d4a896aabec252d3f1c7e4cdb00b5fd42fd1221faf25a",
      "text": "……嘛，毕竟是有那个秋月凉在的组合嘛。\n我们本来也没觉得你们低人一等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b83a4d74cedd249fa97735171de30eec11a64f9230395eaf9278e920f34d67f3",
      "text": "只是受了现场紧绷气氛的影响吧……\n做出那种不像竞争对手该有的难看行径，对不住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a",
      "text": "诶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b98d02428a43ac9e85af9fb54ece557b61bdbb451accc3d2d59d7791112456c5",
      "text": "竞、竞争对手！？\n能被男孩子认作对手，太让我感动了～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f2b239411c11d19bb1fcc94757890e2d553883299fea6adb6e284a259895bc",
      "text": "哇哈哈。我们才刚出道嘛。我也和凉\n一样，竞争对手增加了很开心！对吧老师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5151c066253b7bf671425d03079f3e5544ee37c993dc636a470a0d3731e3cee1",
      "text": "…嗯。我们也要向你们的舞台表演\n学习。学习何谓偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8297ea9c6f65b04bd2b191e79b38226793b3ba9e075cddf14a10efb35decffc3",
      "text": "哈哈……我们也是！\n期待下次有机会同台合作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b080810f1ff45d5558062dd38b0c26f7a7a011d37ac41324b53d31c3bddc7356",
      "text": "现场各位的气氛，\n一下子变得明朗起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f156211eb0e4853ba90b5e7e1e99780c5771ddf690269338a1ae7959b910f044",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，我的心情也变得更加明朗了！\n果然，久违地上音乐节目还是有点紧张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df1645bdd120b36447395d84f38a0f52a331cf04b9a062cfe685ccd02bfb752a",
      "text": "…想必是这样吧。即便如此，\n我们的舞台也确实带给了人们笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c99d6141c19960e2b061e92e78f54fdc72fe5bd89afb5574674577883614764",
      "text": "…镜头这边的所有人都在微笑着。\n这份心意，一定会传染给观众的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000198:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6af47d1abd431bf1cb7db1780b41b6a9f37df414a787e589ebb1aff18cda3f2c",
      "text": "节目播完了呢！\n不知道粉丝们看得很开心吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9f71192ed445fa0a409209dfcfff9984b7f1d3b8d44e6f2de9bd4efbfbcdd51",
      "text": "大家肯定都展露笑容了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da2ddb889d0a3eacdc9be93c690c0a4a1581f5188f9478f759e4912dc90ec36",
      "text": "不过，我的紧张\n隔着电视都传过来了呢…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16385405a316f59e42f8234ea1bfcf74addf869c73aa745d90ff9b5e558cb9fd",
      "text": "我也差不多。\n谈话环节的时候，紧张尤其全写在脸上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2233359c174f59222067dab34f2b6fcacda10996f27ae6f90bdad859d34bc835",
      "text": "在这一点上，我觉得凉跟平时没什么两样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:935fadf0c6d8f41d8b35364a6d5cbf05513543d978a2b3be58b3f9ce5c7c2e11",
      "text": "哦，我也这么觉得！\n那就是习惯和经验上的差距了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000217:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbc204511b16368e272b7dc4052db27eee856998a4e12b032169bd21f88708bb",
      "text": "真的吗？\n明明长着一张一眼就能看出超级紧张的脸来着<emoji>image_talk_emoji_14</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000219:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb0e96d732369bf51734fc6913af702bf97dfd452220063f3769cdc1a594437a",
      "text": "不过，大家一唱起歌来\n紧张感就烟消云散了呢。\n看起来非常开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000221:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aa766bdfbd643b081c51dc00148a410d535a8d97a0133295082682c585e4ed1",
      "text": "播放量在增长哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000221:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da82106c5ddde173605bb0fe6f4ce7aca6061eae4a39c163a3ada802e7c705ec",
      "text": "播出后，大家上传到315 Pro官方\n频道的视频播放量在持续上涨哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000224:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0de1d886b96975510f82f94e8c3f61f5395a938ce52eda41521d0a8f5f624359",
      "text": "真高兴啊！也就是说对我们\n感兴趣的人变多了吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000226:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcfe8304a8c7d48968c8dd9a523738a8b0449af503cb13efa38afe27381b08b1",
      "text": "既然受到了更多关注，\n我们就重新打起精神来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_i:cmd-000228:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eec33f23974c79d59d612872e7fff686820a18004cabb26c9ccfb01c9b89111b",
      "text": "好的！为了能让更多的人\n展露笑容，从明天开始也继续加油吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
